From 20d28e77ff23c947b4db12fbbfc061a618a321f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sn3ro <zak.darek@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:52:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(kernel): a SolidCraft 0.48.1 design with fillets imports
 the body of its STEP export

A pinned release fixture for the SolidCraft import: filleted_block.sc
(a 40 x 30 x 20 mm block with a blend face, saved by SolidCraft 0.48.1)
and its own STEP export. The new test imports the two and compares the
design name, the units, the face count, the box and the volume, then
meshes the two at 0.005 mm and compares the meshes. The STEP file gets
its row in the STEP agreement bench (no truck reading, unit agrees).

Fixes #2578

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
